{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat</h2>After millennia, a powerful, mind-altering artifact has resurfaced. Malevolent creatures are doing everything they can to gain access to its might. You need to stop them. Use a vast collection of weapons to defeat enemies and bosses.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2166740/extras/GroundShockwave.gif?t=1740404083\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Levelling</h2>Find allies to help you on your quest. Level them up so they become a specific class of warriors by unlocking certain skills. Choose between Fighter, Archer or Wizard, each with their unique subclasses. Or combine them to make versatile warriors.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Lore</h2>Learn about the lore of the world through talking to NPC's and reading old scrolls and books found in dungeons. Stop by shops to stock up on weapons, potions and armor.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2166740/extras/ReadingBook.gif?t=1740404083\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Use an elaborate combat system to slay your foes.<br></li><li> Detailed lore to learn about.<br></li><li> Bosses to kill.<br></li><li> In-depth leveling system.<br></li><li> Shop system to upgrade your equipment.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2166740?t=1740404083","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2166740?t=1740404083","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2166740/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740404083","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2166740/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740404083","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat</h2>After millennia, a powerful, mind-altering artifact has resurfaced. Malevolent creatures are doing everything they can to gain access to its might. You need to stop them. Use a vast collection of weapons to defeat enemies and bosses.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2166740/extras/GroundShockwave.gif?t=1740404083\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Levelling</h2>Find allies to help you on your quest. Level them up so they become a specific class of warriors by unlocking certain skills. Choose between Fighter, Archer or Wizard, each with their unique subclasses. Or combine them to make versatile warriors.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Lore</h2>Learn about the lore of the world through talking to NPC's and reading old scrolls and books found in dungeons. Stop by shops to stock up on weapons, potions and armor.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2166740/extras/ReadingBook.gif?t=1740404083\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Use an elaborate combat system to slay your foes.<br></li><li> Detailed lore to learn about.<br></li><li> Bosses to kill.<br></li><li> In-depth leveling system.<br></li><li> Shop system to upgrade your equipment.</li></ul>","developers":["Neusaap & Ivan Smirnoff"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2166740/header.jpg?t=1740404083","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256941661,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256941661/movie480.mp4?t=1681747841","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256941661/movie_max.mp4?t=1681747841"},"name":"IntroAnimation","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256941661/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1681747841","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steam